# .gitattributes — line endings and binary files.
#
# Text files are stored and served with LF, whatever the machine's
# core.autocrlf setting, so every checkout (Windows, Linux, CI) produces the
# same bytes. Asset tokens (?v=) depend on those bytes, which is why this
# matches calculia and memofun. Images and fonts are marked binary so git
# never rewrites their bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
